<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'>History: </span></b><span style='font-size:10.0pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>August 15, 2020: <span
class=SpellE>ReadPlate</span> 3.0 version incorporates the capability of
reading multi-well plates <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>of</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'> 6 (3x2), 12 (4x3), 24 (6x4), 48 (8x6) or 96 (12x8)
wells. A new user-friendly interface <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>facilitates</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'> image analysis. This version allows new user-defined
features to optimize blank <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>correction</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'>. Multiple readings of the same plate have also
considerably been facilitated, appending <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>the</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'> full parameter file to the results and log file <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>February 16, 2018:
ReadPlate2.1 incorporates an improved blank correction algorithm <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>April 15, 2016: ReadPlate2
introduces a correction for blank measurements <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>March 10, 2016: Inclusion of
alpha numeric labeling for the wells and calculation <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>of</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'> absorbance values <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>December 16, 2015: Original
version <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>With thanks to Sandra <span
class=SpellE>Verstraeten</span>, Pablo <span class=SpellE>Carabias</span>,
Irene <span class=SpellE>Mangialavori</span> and Gabriela Gomez for <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>their</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'> enthusiasm, suggestions and help with this project <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'>Key words: </span></b><span style='font-size:10.0pt'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Plate reader, <span
class=SpellE>microplate</span> reader, <span class=SpellE>microtiter</span>
plate photometry, absorbance, digital camera, <span class=GramE>cell</span>-phone
camera <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

