style='font-size:10.0pt'>Relevant literature reference: <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Carla R. <span class=SpellE>Angelani</span>,
Pablo <span class=SpellE>Carabias</span>, Karen M. Cruz, Jose M. Delfino, <span
class=SpellE>Marilina</span> de <span class=SpellE>Sautu</span>, <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Maria V. <span class=SpellE>Espelt</span>,
<span class=SpellE>Mariela</span> S. Ferreira-Gomes, Gabriela E. Gomez, Irene
C. <span class=SpellE>Mangialavori</span>, <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=SpellE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Malena</span></span><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'> <span class=SpellE>Manzi</span>, Maria F. <span
class=SpellE>Pignataro</span>, Nicolas A. <span class=SpellE>Saffioti</span>, <span
class=SpellE>Damiana</span> M. <span class=SpellE>Salvatierra</span> <span
class=SpellE>Frechou</span>, <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Javier Santos, Pablo J. <span
class=SpellE>Schwarzbaum</span> <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>&quot;A Metabolic Control
Analysis Approach to Introduce the Study of Systems in Biochemistry: <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=GramE><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>the</span></span><span
